When using tools, always use the exact tool name from the available tools list.
Available tool names are: terminal, file_editor, task_tracker, finish, think

To use a tool, respond with the tool name and its parameters in the correct format.

Examples:
- To run a command: Use the "terminal" tool with the command parameter
- To edit a file: Use the "file_editor" tool with the appropriate action
- To finish the task: Use the "finish" tool

IMPORTANT: Never combine tool names or use variations. Use exactly "terminal" not "Filesterminal" or similar.

